 "text": "Riley County Maps | Riley County Official Website\nSkip To Main Content This website is AudioEye enabled and is being optimized for accessibility. To open the AudioEye Toolbar, press \"shift + =\". Some assistive technologies may require the use of a passthrough function before this keystroke. For more information, activate the button labeled \"Explore your accessibility options\".\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\n-->\nHome\nOur County\nGovernment\nServices\nHow Do I?\nContact Us\nSearch\nCommunity GIS Website\nGIS Fee Schedule\nMaps\nSocial Media Policy\nRiley County Public Data Request Form\nHome\nGovernment\nDepartments\nIT/GIS\nMaps\nRiley County Maps\nThe below maps are available in PDF format and may be viewed, downloaded or printed. For more detailed information, please see our GIS Website . The GIS Public Map Portal allows for an interactive (both on a computer and mobile device) experience with a variety of maps and information.\nFlood Maps\nArmy Corp Tuttle Creek Dam Failure Evacuation and Inundation Zones (pdf)\nTuttle Creek Dam Failure Evacuation and Inundation Zones (pdf)\nHistoric Disaster Maps\n1993 Flood Map (pdf)\n2008 Manhattan Tornado Damage Assessment Map (pdf)\nReference Maps\nCemetery Districts (pdf)\nHydrology of Riley County (pdf)\nManhattan Area Schools (pdf)\nManhattan Elementary School Attendance Zones_October 2021 (pdf)\nManhattan Public Buildings (pdf)\nRiley County School Districts_July 2023 (pdf)\nRiley County Taxing Unit Map July 2026 (pdf)\nVoting Precincts - City of Manhattan_April 2026 (pdf)\nVoting Precincts - Riley County_April 2026 (pdf)\nRoad Maps\nAshland Township Roads (pdf)\nBala Township Roads (pdf)\nCenter Township Roads (pdf)\nCity of Manhattan Map Website\nFancy Creek Township Roads (pdf)\nGrant Township Roads (pdf)\nJackson Township Roads (pdf)\nMadison Township Roads (pdf)\nManhattan Township Roads (pdf)\nMay Day Township Roads (pdf)\nOgden Township Roads (pdf)\nRiley County Road Map (pdf)\nRiley County Township Map (pdf)\nSherman Township Roads (pdf)\nSwede Creek Township Roads (pdf)\nWildcat Township Roads (pdf)\nZeandale Township Roads (pdf)\nZoning Maps\nCity of Leonardville Zoning Map (pdf)\nCity of Ogden Zoning Map (pdf)\nCity of Riley Zoning Map (pdf)\nFort Riley Noise Zones (pdf)\nRiley County Zoning Map (pdf)\nCommission Meetings\nMotor Vehicles\nDistrict Court\nEmployment\nElection Information\nOnline Payment\n-->\nContact Us\nRiley County Offices\n110 Courthouse Plaza\nManhattan, KS 66502\nPhone: 785-565-6200\nFax: 785-537-6394\nSocial Media\nFacebook\nYoutube\nInstagram\nHelpful Links\nATA Bus\nBurn Permits\nCommission Meetings\nDistrict Court\nDriver's Licenses\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nHelpful Links\nHome\nStaff Directory\nTranslate\nSite Map\n/QuickLinks.aspx\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nLoading\nLoading\nDo Not Show Again\nClose\nClose ×\nOpens in new window\nPDF Download\nWord Download\nExcel Download\nPowerPoint Download\nDocument Download\nExplore your accessibility options",
